                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "begin": 945,
                          "end": 1091,
                          "text": "While the general sorting was reasonable, there is concern regarding sorting by season alone first, which may leave out plants that flower twice.",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "plain-text",
                              "begin": 945,
                              "end": 1090,
                              "value": "While the general sorting was reasonable, there is concern regarding sorting by season alone first, which may leave out plants that flower twice."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "begin": 1104,
                      "end": 1258,
                      "text": "While we indeed sort by season first, we have been very conservative: a plant that flowers twice appears in both seasons, and the index points to both.",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "plain-text",
                          "begin": 1104,
                          "end": 1255,
                          "value": "While we indeed sort by season first, we have been very conservative: a plant that flowers twice appears in both seasons, and the index points to both."
                        }
